# comment-indented-hash-word

## Input

```
  #indented_word value
key value #word

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..39
  COMMENT@0..22 "  #indented_word value"
  NEWLINE@22..23 "\n"
  ENTRY@23..39
    WORD_KEY@23..26
      WORD@23..26 "key"
    SPACE@26..27 " "
    LINE_STRING@27..32
      STRING@27..32 "value"
    COMMENT@32..38 " #word"
    NEWLINE@38..39 "\n"
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@23..26 "key",
            },
            value: LineString {
                string: STRING@27..32 "value",
            },
        },
    ],
}
```

